{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03944","headline":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方军大总管张仁亶 · 李适","name":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方军大总管张仁亶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地限骄南牧，天临饯北征。\n解衣延宠命，横劒总威名。\n豹略恭宸旨，雄文动睿情。\n坐观膜拜入，朝夕受降城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}